		{"id":"group","type":"group","x":-100,"y":-80,"width":2580,"height":1560,"color":"6","label":"Typography, Markdown, and Node Geometry"},
		{"id":"intro","type":"text","text":"# Typography and Node Test\n\nEvery card below isolates a formatting or geometry case. The export should stay readable, aligned, clipped, and visually consistent in light and dark themes.","x":0,"y":20,"width":1900,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"headings","type":"text","text":"# Heading One\n## Heading Two\n### Heading Three\n#### Heading Four\n\nBody text follows the complete heading scale.","x":0,"y":260,"width":360,"height":310,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"wide","type":"text","text":"## Extra-wide node\nA wide card checks horizontal composition, border radius, line length, and edge anchoring.","x":1650,"y":655,"width":650,"height":120,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"inline","type":"text","text":"## Inline Formatting\n\n**Bold text**\n\n*Italic text*\n\n~~Strikethrough~~\n\n`inline code`\n\n[External link](https://obsidian.md)","x":640,"y":260,"width":360,"height":310,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"tasks","type":"text","text":"## Lists and Tasks\n\n1. First ordered item\n2. Second ordered item\n\n- Parent item\n  - Nested item\n\n- [x] Complete\n- [ ] Incomplete","x":1325,"y":260,"width":360,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"quote","type":"text","text":"## Quote and Divider\n\n> Good exports preserve hierarchy, spacing, and contrast.\n\n---\n\nA divider should remain subtle but visible.","x":1975,"y":260,"width":360,"height":310,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"long","type":"text","text":"## Long Content\n\nThis deliberately long paragraph verifies predictable line wrapping and clipping. It repeats enough information to exceed a compact card without escaping its border, covering neighboring nodes, or exposing the Canvas grid through the surface. A professional export should keep the visual hierarchy intact even when source content is larger than the available rectangle.","x":700,"y":640,"width":350,"height":270,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"code","type":"text","text":"## Code Block\n\n```ts\nconst output = await exportCanvas({\n  theme: 'dark',\n  scale: 2,\n});\n```\n\nThe block must clip inside the card.","x":0,"y":640,"width":500,"height":270,"color":"5"},
